WEBVTT

00:41:01.070 --> 00:41:06.566
If you consider the last pandemic,
which was like 100 years ago,

00:41:06.590 --> 00:41:09.686
and if you consider what
we have been able to accomplish

00:41:09.710 --> 00:41:12.390
as a species in a hundred years,

00:41:12.414 --> 00:41:15.106
it's mind-blowing.

00:41:15.130 --> 00:41:18.776
I am absolutely confident
that we will get through this,

00:41:18.800 --> 00:41:22.546
but it's going to take all of us
working together,

00:41:22.570 --> 00:41:25.866
making the right decisions,
doing the right things.

00:41:25.890 --> 00:41:28.246
Teamwork is absolutely critical

00:41:28.270 --> 00:41:30.405
when you're trying
to do something like this.